                        <div class="hotel-facilities">
                            <ul>
                                <li>Individually-controlled air conditioning</li>
                                <li>Stateroom layout: king-size bed or twin beds</li>
                                <li>Interconnecting staterooms available (children welcome)</li>
                                <li>Minibar</li>
                                <li>Flat screen satellite TV</li>
                                <li>Bose™ Bluetooth speaker</li>
                                <li>Desk with stationery</li>
